  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<h3>宜家福州商场营业时间</h3>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">商场、瑞典风味小餐馆、瑞典特色食品屋</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: black;\">周一至周日</span><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp; 10:30-21:30</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">瑞典风味餐厅</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: black;\">周一至周日</span><span style=\"color: black;\"> 10:00-20:30</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: black;\">您也可以选择宜家家居</span><span style=\"color: black;\">APP</span><span style=\"color: black;\">、小程序购买产品、在线进行全屋设计或公司采购。</span></p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": {
    "traceId": "商场信息"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br /><strong>商场地址：</strong>福建省福州市晋安区福马路788号</p>\n<p><strong>自驾：</strong><br />地图搜索宜家家居<br />地下停车场全天开放<br />地下停车场配备有6个电车快充及3个电车慢充充电桩供使用</p>\n<p><strong>乘坐地铁：</strong><br />2号线上洋站，E2出口出站至地面后步行约100米可到达</p>\n<p><strong>乘坐公交：</strong><br />磨洋河站：7路、9路、29路、70路、73路<br />福州公交宜家停车场站：69路、78路</p>",
    "pub-text"
   ],
